{"seq":2,"slug":"core-contributions","title":"老子·core-contributions","stage":"DONE","category":"laozi","categoryLabel":"老子","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/core-contributions","rating":{"composite":3.8,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/15_laozi/2_core-contributions","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"核心贡献\">核心贡献</h1><p>如果只用一句话概括老子留给后世的东西，那就是：他给了中国思想一个全新的最高问题。在他之前，人们追问的是&quot;礼该如何安排人事&quot;&quot;天命要我们做什么&quot;；老子第一次把目光抬到一切之上，去问&quot;万物的总根源与总规律是什么&quot;，并用一个字——&quot;道&quot;——来回答。这一问，开辟了中国哲学的形而上层面，也奠定了一个能与儒家并立两千余年的思想传统。</p>\n<p>本卷专门梳理这份贡献的实质内容，区别于其他几卷的分工：老子其人的生平与传说见第一卷《生平与时代》，他思想的具体方法（无为而治、柔弱胜刚强等）见第三卷《思想与方法》，《道德经》作为文本的细节见第四卷《主要著作》，而它对后世与世界的影响见第五卷《影响与遗产》。这里聚焦的是&quot;老子究竟贡献了哪些根本性的东西&quot;。</p>\n<p>全卷分三章，循一条由源到流的线索展开。第一章&quot;开创道家&quot;，讲他如何凭一个&quot;道&quot;字开宗立派、被后世追认为道家始祖，以及&quot;道&quot;这一最高范畴的三重含义。第二章&quot;《道德经》&quot;，讲这部五千言、八十一章的经典如何以最简的文字搭起最完整的哲学体系。第三章&quot;全新的世界观&quot;，讲由&quot;道法自然&quot;与辩证智慧（反者道之动、物极必反）合成的那套看待世界的方式。</p>\n<p>阅读时不必拘泥章序，但若是初次接触，建议从第一章&quot;道的概念&quot;读起——它是理解后面一切的钥匙。本卷各篇都以《道德经》具体章句为据，可与第三、四卷相互参看。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"founding-daoism","title":"开创道家","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/core-contributions/founding-daoism","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-father-of-daoism","title":"道家的始祖","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/core-contributions/founding-daoism/the-father-of-daoism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-concept-of-dao","title":"道的概念","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/core-contributions/founding-daoism/the-concept-of-dao"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-tao-te-ching","title":"《道德经》","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/core-contributions/the-tao-te-ching","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"five-thousand-words","title":"五千言的经典","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/core-contributions/the-tao-te-ching/five-thousand-words"},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-philosophical-classic","title":"哲学的经典","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/core-contributions/the-tao-te-ching/a-philosophical-classic"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"a-new-worldview","title":"全新的世界观","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/core-contributions/a-new-worldview","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dao-and-nature","title":"道与自然","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/core-contributions/a-new-worldview/dao-and-nature"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dialectical-wisdom","title":"辩证的智慧","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/core-contributions/a-new-worldview/dialectical-wisdom"}]}]}